  <p id="c-songshu-050-huzunshi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-050-huzunshi:p001:m0000" ref="otw_1ui_wba">藩</persName>第十四子<persName id="c-songshu-050-huzunshi:p001:m0005" ref="otw_1ui_wba_B">遵世</persName>，為<persName id="c-songshu-050-huzunshi:p001:m0009" ref="0zd_9uz_t7m_ABA">臧質</persName>寧遠參軍，去職還家，與<persName id="c-songshu-050-huzunshi:p001:m0022" ref="vhw_07a_wzm_ABA">孔熙先</persName>同逆謀，太祖以<persName id="c-songshu-050-huzunshi:p001:m0032" ref="otw_1ui_wba">藩</persName>功臣，不欲顯其事，使江州以他事收殺之。</p>
</text>
